page("guides/index.html", "/guides/", "CV Guides, Regional Formats and Examples by Job | Free AI CV Tailor", "Free CV guides, 22 regional CV formats and examples for office, sales, IT, nursing, teaching and more, with a free ATS score checker.", idx)
page("about.html", "/about", "About Free AI CV Tailor", "Free AI CV Tailor helps job seekers tailor their CV to a job, check their ATS score and download it for free.", '<h1>About Free AI CV Tailor</h1><p>Free AI CV Tailor helps job seekers match their CV to each job. You upload your CV, add the job, choose a template and regional format, and download the result as PDF or Word. It also includes an ATS score checker, a cover letter writer and a design studio.</p><p>The AI can make mistakes. It is told to use only facts from your CV, and the site flags details it cannot find in your original, but you are responsible for checking the final CV before you send it.</p><p>The project is free and open source: <a href="' + GH + '" target="_blank" rel="noopener">view it on GitHub</a>. Questions or feedback? Email <a href="mailto:' + EMAIL + '">' + EMAIL + '</a>.</p><a class="btn" href="/">Build my CV free</a>')
priv = '''<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><small>This is a plain-language summary of how the site works, not legal advice.</small></p>
<h2>What you submit</h2><p>When you upload or paste a CV and a job description, your file is read in your browser. The text is sent to our server function only to generate the result you asked for (CV, ATS tips, cover letter, translation, interview questions or LinkedIn text). We do not save it in a database and we do not keep a copy.</p>
<h2>AI processing</h2><p>The text is processed by Cloudflare Workers AI. Cloudflare states that it does not use customer content to train the AI models available on Workers AI or to improve its services, and that it does not store the content unless a storage product is used alongside it. This site does not use any storage product for your CV. Cloudflare, like any web host, still processes standard technical data such as IP addresses to run its network.</p>
<p id="gem" hidden>Some requests may also be processed by Google's Gemini API on a paid plan, where Google states it does not use prompts and responses to improve its products.</p>
<h2>Scanned files and photos</h2><p>If you upload a scanned PDF or a photo of your CV, the text is recognised inside your browser with the open-source Tesseract.js library. The file itself is not uploaded. Your browser downloads the recognition engine and its language data from public content delivery networks (jsDelivr and the Tesseract data host), which can see a normal download request but not your file.</p>
<h2>Your browser</h2><p>Your photo, saved templates, job tracker entries and Design Studio drafts are stored only in your own browser and are never uploaded. You can remove them by clearing this site's data in your browser settings. A share link contains your CV text inside the web address, so anyone with the link can read it; share it only with people you trust.</p>
<h2>Cookies, ads and partner links</h2><p>The site may show partner (affiliate) links, which are clearly labelled and may earn us a commission at no cost to you. <span id="adp" hidden>The site currently shows advertising; ad providers may use cookies to show and measure ads.</span></p>
<h2>Accuracy</h2><p>The AI can make mistakes. Please check names, dates and details before you send your CV to anyone.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p id="contact">Questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:''' + EMAIL + '''">''' + EMAIL + '''</a>.</p>
<script src="/site-config.js"></script><script>(function(){var S=window.SITE||{};if(S.usesGemini)document.getElementById("gem").hidden=false;if(S.ENABLE_ADS)document.getElementById("adp").hidden=false;if(S.contactEmail){var c=document.getElementById("contact");c.textContent="Questions about privacy? Email ";var a=document.createElement("a");a.href="mailto:"+S.contactEmail;a.textContent=S.contactEmail;c.appendChild(a);c.appendChild(document.createTextNode("."))}})();</script>'''
page("privacy.html", "/privacy", "Privacy Policy | Free AI CV Tailor", "How Free AI CV Tailor handles your CV text, photo and browser data. We do not store your CV.", priv)

